<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia September gross wages rise 17.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia September gross wages rise 17.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>    AVERAGE GROSS WAGES	    Sept	Aug	Sept 95</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	   +0.5     -0.4	 -0.7</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)	     17.8     17.2	 18.5</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
